  "every action row has at least one grounded frame (bottom_y_top == row_origin + anchor.y)",
  "the Run row keeps airborne frames (bottom_y_top < row_origin + anchor.y)",
  "PNG asset sha256 and IHDR dimensions match the checked-in il2cpp/Assets bytes"
 ]
}
